  "ruleText": "Lan 301.05 Additional References. The applicant shall provide the names and addresses of additional references if the original information provided by the references is unclear, incomplete, contradictory, or outdated.\n\nSource. #7549, eff 8-25-01; ss by #9340, eff 1-1-09; ss by #12031, eff 11-1-16",
